    guidMasterKey    : {90226a7d-5440-4498-8631-8b8f39292ebc}
    size             : 1318
    flags            : 0x14
    algHash/algCrypt : 32782 (CALG_SHA_512) / 26128 (CALG_AES_256)
    description      :
    [X] MasterKey GUID not in cache: {90226a7d-5440-4498-8631-8b8f39292ebc} However, our attempts to decrypt these blobs by providing the GUID:SHA1 values required did not result in credentials as expected. SharpDPAPI.exe blob /target: {90226a7d-5440-4498-8631-8b8f39292ebc}:EEF09F0F62C03E67D419A21812253B9F8D4B9257

